---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { operator, legalPlaceholder } from '../data/legal';
---

<Legal title="Privacy Policy" description="How SIMPLUGELITE.COM handles personal data: no cookies, no tracking, no forms.">
  <p>
    <strong>Short version:</strong> this website does not use cookies, analytics, tracking pixels, advertising networks, contact forms
    or customer accounts. Fonts and images are served from this website itself — no third-party requests are made while you browse.
  </p>

  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>
    {operator.name || <span class="placeholder">{legalPlaceholder}</span>}{operator.city && `, ${operator.city}`}
    — see the <a href="/imprint">Imprint</a> for contact details.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting and server logs</h2>
  <p>
    This website is delivered by {operator.host}. When you visit, the hosting provider technically processes your IP address, the
    requested page, date and time, and browser information, in order to deliver the website and protect it against attacks
    (Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR). We do not use these data to identify visitors.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact via messengers</h2>
  <p>
    If you contact us via Signal, Threema, Telegram, Instagram or Viber, the data you send (for example your username and message
    content) is processed to answer your request and handle any order (Art. 6 (1) (b) GDPR). The privacy policy of the respective
    messenger provider also applies. Links to these services are only followed when you click them.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection, as well as the
    right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority.
  </p>
</Legal>
